\chapter{Technical documentation}
\label{chap:technical-documentation}

The \LibraryName library is a low-level C implementation of the TM. It is optimized for speed and size, making it suitable for environments with limited resources. It comes with a model serialization format designed to minimize model size and a way to convert existing \GreenTsetlinName models to this format. It is also possible to use \LibraryName conveniently from Python with the same syntax as many popular Machine Learning libraries thanks to its python bindings.

